# RT-OMM-SER (nextgen RT/PT, owner 11-23 highest priority): opacity micromaps (VK_EXT_opacity_micromap, GPU bake at BLAS
# build, Programs/RayTracing/OpacityMicromapBake.shader) and shader execution reordering (VK_NV_ray_tracing_invocation_reorder,
# DESERT_SER raygen permutation) change the TIME of the RT passes, never the picture.
# Two runs of this file, same tree, same scene, same camera: run A with machine.json (ProjectContext::ConfigDirectory)
# WITHOUT HideOpacityMicromap / HideInvocationReorder (both features on; the start-up catalog line shows
# "rtfeat=OpacityMicromap,InvocationReorder"), run B with "HideOpacityMicromap": true and "HideInvocationReorder": true
# (the catalog line shows no rtfeat). The editor reads machine.json at launch, so each run is its own launch.
# Frames of run A go under frames/on, run B under frames/off. Compare = per-pixel diff (never thumbnails).
# The profile table (DesertCtl profile-dump) is the profiler's per-scope table over the last 0.5 s in editor.log.
Проект F:/BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,170,330
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,-0.45,-0.66
Когда state device
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 120
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид 0_rt_shadows [omm_on_off] the bush and tree leaves cast alpha-cut shadows (holes between leaves, no solid quads); run A vs run B: per-pixel diff of 0_rt_shadows within noise (max |d| <= 2/255 outside the stochastic-shadow noise floor of two run-B frames); the RT shadow pass's GPU time in the profile table of run A LOWER than run B's; editor.log of run A has "[RayTracing] opacity micromaps:" with baked > 0; 0 VUID
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Off"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 64"
Когда frames 200
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид 1_pt [ser_on_off] run A vs run B: per-pixel diff of 1_pt within the PT noise of 64 paths (mean luminance within 1 %, the 5 x 5 local std of the diff not above that of two run-B frames with different seeds); the PathTracer raygen GPU time of run A NOT ABOVE run B's; 0 VUID
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method Level"
Тогда 9_level overrides removed (machine.json clean of the Quality overrides; the Hide* rows of run B are taken back by hand)
